{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105761","id":2482112537,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6T8ggZ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105761","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105761.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105761.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105761","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105761/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105761/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105761/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f064a415b3d51667b224c144473ddccf0a4b0578","number":105761,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use `PagedAllocator` for `StringName` to accelerate and localize allocations.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Requires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105760 (out of convenience)\r\n\r\nI propose to change `memnew` calls in `StringName` with a dedicated `PagedAllocator`. This should accelerate allocation and deallocation and reduce used RAM.\r\n\r\nThis is an alternative to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104372 (using vector instead of linked lists) and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97016 (adding a new allocator).\r\nThis PR is a much less extreme change, so I'd prefer if it was merged first and the other PRs tested against this one afterwards.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nI benchmarked a ~6% acceleration for `Node` creation and deletion:\r\n```c++\r\n\tNode *parent = memnew(Node);\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 2000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\tNode *child = memnew(Node);\r\n\t\t\tparent->add_child(child);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tArray children = parent->get_children();\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 2000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\tparent->remove_child((Node *)(Object *)children.get(i));\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis yields:\r\n```\r\n2364ms\r\n708ms\r\n```\r\n(master)\r\n\r\n```\r\n2240ms\r\n682ms\r\n```\r\n(this PR)\r\n\r\nI also profiled a ~13mb decrease of RAM use in the editor (using Apple Instruments):\r\n- `master` uses `1540705200b`\r\n- this PR uses `1527547728b`\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nThe allocator's `reset` could be called, but then it would also need to have `configure` be called appropriately as well.\r\nI'm not sure it's necessary to do this since we're cleaning up anyway.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at"